  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The one who wears these moves with a predator's grace, crossing treacherous ground without a sound. These boots grant a swiftness of limb that defies the heavy fatigue of long travel. They were taken from a servant of Khamul, forged for survival in the deep shadows of Dol Guldur."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Coarse leather and blackened hide bind the feet, worn smooth by miles of trekking through shadow. The soles are thick and reinforced to muffle every footfall against stone and soil."
    }
  },
